Prompt Engineering Lab

A research-focused repository dedicated to exploring prompt engineering techniques and evaluating LLM behavior under different prompting strategies.


Overview

This project investigates how prompt structure influences AI outputs across multiple dimensions including:

- Reasoning quality
- Instruction adherence
- Response consistency
- Output formatting
- Safety and ambiguity handling

Objectives

- Test prompt reliability
- Compare prompting strategies
- Analyze model consistency
- Improve instruction-following performance
- Study prompt sensitivity


